NIO (Modern Java)

Nowadays, many developers use the java.nio.file package.

Path path = Path.of("notes.txt");

Read the whole file:

String text = Files.readString(path);

Write:

Files.writeString(path, "Hello");

Copy:

Files.copy(source, destination);

Delete:

Files.delete(path);

The Files utility class makes many common tasks simpler than the older java.io APIs.

